URE the strip (PLAYBOOK 10.1).** v1 was delivered & watched; prior session coded v2 + generated all assets; this session rebuilt manifest → QC'd the 2 new clips → rendered → QC'd → delivered. ✅ **APPROVED & FINAL (Jarrad, 2026-07-06)** — v3 is the final cut. Chapter 5 opening video from locked master `_master-transcripts.md` Slot 07 (`Chapter 5 - FINAL.srt`), **cues 1–10 only** (slot is ~8:40/~1400 words → split at its own Step-1/Step-2 pivot). 5A = how to open the call: 15-sec intro, the model opening script, pre-qualified frame, approval/denial intrigue, "good time?" objection, pen-and-paper compliance move, build-trust, landline-vs-cell, + the 80/20 listen mindset (cue 10, reframed as bridge). **Cues 11–16 (fact-find mechanics) saved as `shotlists/lesson-5B-script.txt` for a future 5B tab.** 13 beats; cafe-Andrea bookends (`b2cd0545…`) + BMH badge b01; **Seedance animates scene beats** (b03 rep-on-phone, b07 writing hand, b08 seller-off-couch, b10 opt. card-handoff); **Remotion does transitions + word-timed Sticker text + corner circles only** (Jarrad 2026-07-05: Remotion is NOT for animating scenes). Storyboard APPROVED by Jarrad; stills generating. Master deviations to record: 5A intro/outro rewritten for the split (outro teases 5B, not the roleplay); 5B's tease is the cue-17 roleplay-vs-Ch6 decision (flag when 5B is queued). **Owns only `*lesson5A*` / `module-05` paths**: `shotlists/module-05-lesson5A-*`, `remotion/src/Lesson5A.tsx`, `remotion/public/lesson5A/`, `course-assets/scenes/module-05/`, `course-assets/heygen/lesson5A/`, `review-lesson5A/`, `scripts/*_5A.*`, + `shotlists/lesson-5B-script.txt`. DO NOT TOUCH.
